{"id":"e4a27d7be1b49de0","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-smooth-invariant.md","title":"Smooth Invariants","display":"thm-smooth-invariant — Smooth Invariants","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-smooth-invariant","aliases":["58-thm-smooth-invariant"],"display":"thm-smooth-invariant — Smooth Invariants","depends_on":["[[58-df-diffeomorphism]]","[[58-df-betti-numbers]]","[[58-prop-euler-char]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-smooth-invariant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-smooth-invariant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smooth-invariant — Smooth Invariants"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb1491fbbaff37d\" href=\"?note=1cb1491fbbaff37d\" title=\"58-df-diffeomorphism\">58-df-diffeomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"025c5240f130d970\" href=\"?note=025c5240f130d970\" title=\"58-df-betti-numbers\">58-df-betti-numbers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e7476d444d4ade0\" href=\"?note=5e7476d444d4ade0\" title=\"58-prop-euler-char\">58-prop-euler-char</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,F,m,n\\in V\">\\(M,N,F,m,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_k(-;\\mathbb Q),\\chi:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(b_k(-;\\mathbb Q),\\chi:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}invariant} \\vdash \\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,N,m,n)\\to\\left[\\left(\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;b_k(M;\\mathbb Q)=b_k(N;\\mathbb Q)\\right)\\land\\chi(M)=\\chi(N)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}invariant} \\vdash \\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,N,m,n)\\to\\left[\\left(\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;b_k(M;\\mathbb Q)=b_k(N;\\mathbb Q)\\right)\\land\\chi(M)=\\chi(N)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Betti numbers and Euler characteristic are in fact topological invariants, hence also diffeomorphism invariants.</li>\n<li>Different values obstruct a diffeomorphism; equal values do not classify manifolds.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-diffeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1cb1491fbbaff37d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-diffeomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-betti-numbers","status":"resolved","id":"025c5240f130d970","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-betti-numbers]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-prop-euler-char","status":"resolved","id":"5e7476d444d4ade0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-prop-euler-char]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,F,m,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b_k(-;\\mathbb Q),\\chi:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}invariant} \\vdash \\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(F,M,N,m,n)\\to\\left[\\left(\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;b_k(M;\\mathbb Q)=b_k(N;\\mathbb Q)\\right)\\land\\chi(M)=\\chi(N)\\right]","display":true}],"bytes":904,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4423","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-smooth-invariant.md|58-thm-smooth-invariant]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["1cb1491fbbaff37d","025c5240f130d970","5e7476d444d4ade0"]}